1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Can Call Screen catch scams without blocking real callers?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Start with one simulated call from the final test set.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The classifier scores the transcript, checks the evidence, and chooses BLOCK.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
One decision is a demo. A held-out test shows whether it works consistently.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Final test: 790 of 800 scams caught. Precision 93.9%. Recall 98.8%.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,000
The remaining misses and false alarms show exactly what to improve next.

7
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Next: human-reviewed transcripts, shadow testing, then a controlled holdout.

